# .prettierignore — files excluded from prettier --check.
# Auto-generated build artifacts + machine-written data files + working
# directories. Source-of-truth lives in the script that emits them; prettier
# should not normalize their formatting on a clean checkout (would create
# noisy diffs every build).
node_modules/
dist/
.astro/
public/_astro/
public/pagefind/

# Local working dirs — never meant to ship. CLI tools and agent worktrees
# leave artifacts here. CI on a clean checkout will never see them.
.claude/worktrees/
.worktrees/
.audit/

# Auto-generated by scripts/build-graph-snapshot.mjs at compile time.
# Regenerated on every `npm run build` — formatting this file would produce
# a diff every build with no semantic change.
public/graph-stream.json

# Auto-generated world-map TopoJSON from world-atlas npm package — shipped
# raw as-is. Formatting would inflate the file by ~2× (no whitespace).
public/data/world-map-equirect.json
public/data/world-map-ortho.json